:: Test_Index
<h1>Test index</h1>
<<if setup.config.debug>>
Scenario checks for proving the framework works. These pages only matter in debug mode.

* [[Phase 0 — setup checks|Test_Phase0]]
* [[Storyline shortcuts (therapy, travel)|Test_Therapy]]

[[Back to start|Start]]
<<else>>
Test pages are only available in debug mode.
<</if>>

:: Test_Phase0 [nobr]
<h1>Phase 0 — setup checks</h1>
<<set _checks to [
	["SugarCube version is 2.37.3", [version.major, version.minor, version.patch].join(".") === "2.37.3"],
	["History keeps one moment", Config.history.maxStates === 1],
	["History controls hidden", Config.history.controls === false],
	["Wikifier output cleanup on", Config.cleanupWikifierOutput === true],
	["Seeded random is on", setup.sc.prngEnabled()],
	["Save version matches schema", Config.saves.version === setup.SCHEMA_VERSION],
	["Game state created ($meta)", typeof $meta === "object" && $meta.schemaVersion === setup.SCHEMA_VERSION],
	["window.GAME is set in debug", window.GAME === setup],
]>>
<ul class="sys-checks">
<<for _c range _checks>>
	<li><<if _c[1]>><span class="sys-ok">PASS</span><<else>><span class="sys-fail">FAIL</span><</if>> <<= _c[0]>></li>
<</for>>
</ul>
<p>[[Back to test index|Test_Index]]</p>
